\title{Safely Snarkifying the Ethereum Protocol}
\taxon{Talk}
\date{2026-04-02}

\p{\em{Abstract:} I will discuss ongoing work to safely snarkify the Ethereum protocol using formal verification. Expect to learn how formal verification delivers high-assurance code, and how we're using it on zkVMs, SNARKS, and the rest of the Ethereum protocol.}

